About New York ; Button Up Your Overcoat <br />
By DAN BARRY <br />
 <br />
E-mail: dabarry@nytimes.com <br />
 <br />
THESE days have been uncommonly mild for <br />
autumn, but Derek Ivery insists on wearing a <br />
sweater and jacket over his tall and very thin <br />
frame. He cannot get sick. He has things to do. <br />
 <br />
 <br />
