<br />
I didn't know how to answer. I tried to respond, sputtered, tried again, let fly a few eye twitches and finally managed, "Not vanilla."<br />
<br />
"So chocolate?"<br />
<br />
Salt in the wound.<br />
<br />
"I want a Frosty, the original. Not vanilla."<br />
<br />
She nodded, turned to grab a large size cup and vanished for a while. She returned with what I wanted, though it was about three fingers short of full.
