&#8220;One day we were driving with another couple and we got a flat tire,&#8221; recalled Pfister&#8217;s wife, Michelle. &#8220;Somehow, the jack didn&#8217;t work. So Phil picked up the rear of the car and the other guy changed the tire. Phil was the jack. Other drivers on the road passed by and they couldn&#8217;t believe their eyes.&#8221;<br />
