&#8220;I hate this place,&#8221; he said. <br />
<br />
Now he sat on Post 2 again, in the light, watching the advancing trucks. <br />
<br />
&#8220;Out here,&#8221; he said, &#8220;it really makes you love your country. I love my country, man. I love my country. I didn&#8217;t hate my country before, man. But I had some problems with it.&#8221; <br />
