Like this:<br />
<br />
"Stop Sign"<br />
<br />
In Boston, I know I was on prednisone.<br />
I remember that because actually <br />
I came here to visit the White House <br />
When the president was in, <br />
And my head looked like a stop sign. <br />
<br />
&#8212;Feb. 5, 2008, deposition
