<a href="http://gangrey.com/1548">
<h2 class="design">The Death Of Ernie Pyle</h2></a>
<h4 class="byline">'A PHOTOGRAPH SURFACED RECENTLY'</h4>

<p>

<a href="http://www.tampabay.com/features/humaninterest/article435232.ece">Ben Montgomery</a>: If the old man is to be believed, and we have no reason to suspect otherwise, then when Ernie Pyle was killed by a Japanese bullet on the Pacific island of Ie Shima, on April 18, 1945, inside his satchel were notes the respected war reporter had taken the day before.<br />
<br />
