<p>

Congrats to the <a href="http://www.livawards.org/news/index.html">finalists for the Livingston Awards</a>. Some gangreyers on here. Reid. Konrad. Wright. Peter. (Am I missing anybody?)<br />
<br />
Well done, folks. Here's to $10,000.
